 맞은 적이 잠시 느려집니다.\nNo additional words or numbers or stats or prices or placeholder text. No readable writing inside illustration. For corpse, print card title 시체 but no personal character name. Entire card fully visible, no mockup or external shadow.",
+  "refs": [
+    "art/concepts/cards/roles-individual-v02/04-relic-moonlit-charm.png",
