E LINE 1: 땅에 단단한 돌벽을 세웁니다.\nRULE LINE 2: 드워프가 많으면 새벽에 고쳐집니다.\nNo additional words or numbers or stats or prices or placeholder text. No readable writing inside illustration. For corpse, print card title 시체 but no personal character name. Entire card fully visible, no mockup or external shadow.\nLAST INPUT is a text-size and layout GUIDE only, not an artistic style. Match its text scale and center positions. VERY IMPORTANT: leave a visibly large blank cream gap BELOW the title for the second title line. Place category at y285 near the very bottom of a 330px-tall title panel, never immediately below the title. Follow approved painted frame contours, not diagram rectangles. ",
